## 📜 CHANGELOG.md rules (QUEUED — do after patches exist)
- Exactly `/CHANGELOG.md`, case-sensitive, root of repo.
- Sections: `# New` / `# Fixes` / `# App Support` (single # header), each followed by bullets (`-` or `*`).
- ONE patch per bullet; Morphe extracts ONLY bullet text inside those sections as release notes — no extra text anywhere else.
- Used to fix the plain release notes Morphe currently shows.

